        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A SIMPLY SUPERB SPACIOUS 2 BED / 2 BATH HOUSE WITH SUN ROOM AND SOUTH FACING GARDEN IDEALLY SITUATED IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER PRIVATE GATED COMMUNITY OF ROSEDALE A SETTLED NEIGHBOURHOOD IN CLONEE DUBLIN 15\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS HIGHLY RECOMMENDED.... \r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin 15 Property Specialists are delighted to present No. 33 Rosedale Crescent to the Clonee property market. Rosedale is a popular development of superior family homes tucked away in a secluded position. Every conceivable amenity is literally on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nA wonderful investment by any standards N.o 33 will appeal to first time buyers, down-sizers and investors alike. A private driveway welcomes you to this truly beautiful family home. This very fine property has been tastefully decorated and perfectly maintained so it is in excellent condition throughout.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hallway, living room, kitchen / dining room, guest wc and sunroom to the rear. Upstairs there are two double bedrooms, a family bathroom and a hot press.\r\n\r\nA cute entrance porch opens to an attractive generous front living room which is bright and airy. The kitchen / dining room area is also flooded with natural light and offers an abundance of worktop space plus base and eye level storage. Both of the bathrooms have top grade flooring plus quality sanitary ware. The two large double sized bedrooms boast fitted wardrobes. This lovely house features a sun room to the rear a perfect place to relax and/or entertain.\r\n\r\nPlease note the attic area is suitable for conversion. The property has top grade double glazing and a gas fired central heating system. At the rear there is a superb south facing sunny back garden. \r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within a 25 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. Clonsilla Ongar & Dunboyne Villages are within close proximity whilst Blanchardstown Village & Blanchardstown Shopping Centre are literally on your doorstep. Ongar Village and all its amenities is within a 10 minute walk. D. 15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by. The Phoenix Park and Castleknock Village are within a 15 minute drive. The property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. The area is further serviced by an excellent bus route together with Hansfield Train Station making the city most accessible. The N2/N3 and M50 Motorways are also close to hand making this a strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
